                "a": "A- = without, not. Anti- = against. Arch- = chief. Auto- = self. Dia- = through. Dys- = badly. Eu- = well. Hemi- = half. Hyper- = over, beyond. Hypo- = under. Mono- = alone, single. Pan- = all. Philo- = love. Syn- = with, together."
