                "q": "17. The Elephant.",
                "a": "Topical sentence: 'The elephant is the largest and strongest of all land animals.' (Key model: It lives on grass, leaves and roots; its trunk draws up water and can carry huge loads; in Africa elephants are hunted for their tusks, which yield ivory.)"
